WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.133 --> 01:37.933
=Episode 21=

01:43.400 --> 01:44.680
Stop following me around.

01:45.719 --> 01:46.519
Cousin.

01:47.120 --> 01:48.560
People will get the wrong idea.

01:48.680 --> 01:49.200
Look.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.200
What's this?

01:51.040 --> 01:52.480
Why do you have my undergarment?

01:52.480 --> 01:53.239
Give it back!

01:54.079 --> 01:55.359
You'll never explain this.

01:55.920 --> 01:56.879
Either come with me,

01:57.159 --> 01:58.040
or

01:58.239 --> 01:59.359
I'll take this bodice

01:59.359 --> 02:00.920
straight to your aunt and ask
for your hand.

02:01.439 --> 02:02.920
How dare you smear my reputation?

02:03.319 --> 02:03.760
Give it back!

02:03.760 --> 02:04.359
No.

02:04.599 --> 02:05.319
Give it back!

02:05.319 --> 02:05.879
No!

02:06.920 --> 02:07.519
Stop!

02:07.519 --> 02:08.199
What are you doing?

02:12.879 --> 02:14.719
If you truly care for this young lady,

02:15.520 --> 02:17.400
then propose to her properly.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.759
Don't resort to such vile tricks.

02:21.360 --> 02:23.680
If you ever try to ruin
another woman's reputation,

02:26.280 --> 02:27.960
you'd better watch your life.

02:37.280 --> 02:38.159
Don't worry, miss.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.719
Nothing happened here.

02:40.080 --> 02:41.439
We won't tell anyone.

02:43.199 --> 02:44.879
Truly a match made in heaven.

02:50.919 --> 02:52.039
Greetings, Commander Zhao.

02:52.280 --> 02:53.639
I come from Anzhou.

02:53.759 --> 02:54.800
I've traveled all this way

02:55.319 --> 02:56.680
because of the salt reform.

03:04.319 --> 03:05.599
You're the Anzhou merchant?

03:05.919 --> 03:06.680
I am.

03:07.159 --> 03:09.080
I've brought a gift
on behalf of the Anzhou merchants.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.639
My niece

03:10.639 --> 03:11.639
is gentle and obedient.

03:12.840 --> 03:14.360
I hope you'll accept her,
Commander Zhao.

03:18.439 --> 03:19.840
As for the two merchant factions,

03:20.520 --> 03:22.439
the Yan merchants
and the Anzhou merchants,

03:23.039 --> 03:24.879
we'll see which side you favor

03:25.360 --> 03:27.159
by whether you take the girl.

03:27.599 --> 03:28.560
Exactly.

03:34.639 --> 03:36.000
The salt reform is no small matter.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.960
The rivalry between the northern
and southern merchants

03:38.080 --> 03:39.759
is already difficult enough to manage.

03:39.960 --> 03:41.560
He won't reject you to your face

03:41.759 --> 03:43.400
and openly humiliate
the Anzhou merchants.

03:43.840 --> 03:45.159
An opportunity like this is rare.

03:47.479 --> 03:49.439
Zhao Ling is overseeing the salt reform.

03:49.800 --> 03:50.800
If your niece

03:50.800 --> 03:52.280
marries into his family,

03:52.680 --> 03:53.919
he'll be able to help

03:54.400 --> 03:55.800
with the salt trade.

03:57.439 --> 03:58.599
Thank you for the advice, Madam.

04:08.879 --> 04:10.159
Mr. Zhao didn't say he'd accept her,

04:10.400 --> 04:11.560
but he didn't refuse her either.

04:16.000 --> 04:18.399
No wonder Miss Wu
bears some resemblance to you.

04:18.600 --> 04:20.000
So she was specially prepared

04:20.000 --> 04:21.040
as a gift for Commander Zhao.

04:21.279 --> 04:23.199
Miss Xie hasn't even married him yet,

04:23.199 --> 04:24.319
and he's already taking a concubine?

04:24.600 --> 04:25.519
Exactly.

04:40.000 --> 04:40.680
Young Madam,

04:40.879 --> 04:41.959
Young Master is here to pick you up.

04:44.600 --> 04:45.399
Jingxiu.

04:47.759 --> 04:49.639
Young Lord Yu even came
to pick her up himself.

04:49.639 --> 04:50.920
He really does adore her.

04:51.920 --> 04:52.639
Get in.

05:04.759 --> 05:06.040
Safe travels, Miss Xie.

05:22.596 --> 05:24.890
(Yu Residence)

05:24.903 --> 05:27.402
(Fu's Notes)

05:27.680 --> 05:29.199
You and Young Master

05:29.199 --> 05:30.839
have been married for five years,
and he's never taken a concubine.

05:31.279 --> 05:32.759
Those two aren't even married yet,

05:32.959 --> 05:33.879
and Zhao Ling

05:33.879 --> 05:35.120
is taking another woman in.

05:35.279 --> 05:37.000
Young Madam, you certainly
made the better match.

05:38.240 --> 05:39.920
What good

05:41.639 --> 05:43.759
is choosing a husband
for status and power alone?

05:45.240 --> 05:47.040
No matter how successful Zhao Ling is,

05:47.959 --> 05:49.279
without true love,

05:50.720 --> 05:52.279
he may still stray.

05:53.040 --> 05:55.399
You and Young Master married for love,

05:55.600 --> 05:57.079
so naturally your position is secure.

06:03.360 --> 06:04.439
This painting

06:04.439 --> 06:05.759
is truly priceless.

06:05.759 --> 06:07.240
Young Master will surely love it.

06:10.199 --> 06:11.160
Put it here...

06:11.160 --> 06:12.319
Or...

06:13.600 --> 06:14.560
Maybe there.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.639
I never knew

06:42.680 --> 06:45.199
he still had feelings like this.

06:45.639 --> 06:46.839
Please don't be angry, Madam.

06:47.000 --> 06:48.839
Perhaps a servant put it here
by mistake.

06:49.839 --> 06:51.120
There's no need to make excuses for him.

06:52.720 --> 06:54.040
At the first-birthday banquet,

06:55.279 --> 06:57.000
he insisted on adding
the sesame flatbread.

06:57.399 --> 06:58.959
I thought it was strange even then.

07:00.240 --> 07:02.439
This all goes back to what happened
in Huaying.

07:03.079 --> 07:03.639
It forced me

07:03.639 --> 07:05.920
to compete with two girls.

07:06.079 --> 07:07.279
And now look at this.

07:07.959 --> 07:09.240
After all he went through

07:09.240 --> 07:11.040
to marry his precious narcissus,

07:11.279 --> 07:13.399
he spends his days painting
magnolias and thinking of someone else.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.399
How did a family like ours

07:16.120 --> 07:17.920
raise such a hopeless romantic?

07:18.839 --> 07:19.680
Please don't be angry, Madam.

07:19.680 --> 07:20.240
Hurry.

07:20.319 --> 07:20.839
Take it away.

07:25.267 --> 07:26.794
(Rosy in the Evening Glow)

07:32.600 --> 07:33.600
Mother, you wanted to see me?

07:33.920 --> 07:35.000
I've set aside

07:35.000 --> 07:36.720
five hundred taels for you
from the household funds.

07:37.680 --> 07:38.519
Take it.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.240
You're too generous, Mother.

07:45.600 --> 07:47.199
I merely followed your instructions

07:47.199 --> 07:49.480
and had Miss Wu imitate her somewhat.

07:53.319 --> 07:54.600
Consider it

07:54.600 --> 07:55.759
a reward

07:55.759 --> 07:56.879
for handling the matter well.

08:00.399 --> 08:01.879
Buy yourself some cosmetics,

08:02.079 --> 08:03.959
or have a few new dresses made.

08:04.240 --> 08:05.120
Whatever you choose,

08:05.560 --> 08:07.000
just don't skimp on yourself.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.839
Thank you, Mother.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.120
Men spend their days away from home,

08:15.120 --> 08:16.199
working themselves weary.

08:16.839 --> 08:17.879
When they come home,

08:18.199 --> 08:19.720
they want comfort

08:19.720 --> 08:20.639
and peace.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.639
So where effort is needed,

08:23.680 --> 08:24.759
don't grow careless.

08:26.720 --> 08:27.839
Don't worry, Mother.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.240
I'll be sure

08:29.519 --> 08:30.560
to try even harder.

08:32.519 --> 08:33.320
Go on, then.

08:41.679 --> 08:43.960
Madam, you do care
about Young Madam after all.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.879
We're all women.

08:49.679 --> 08:51.519
When something like this happens
in a marriage,

08:51.919 --> 08:53.320
there's bound to be trouble at home.

08:55.120 --> 08:57.200
I only hope she understood what I meant.

08:58.559 --> 09:00.000
Young Madam, you handled the matter
very well.

09:00.480 --> 09:01.879
Madam Yu knows that.

09:03.480 --> 09:05.639
Mother has never cared
how I dress before.

09:09.039 --> 09:11.080
Could she think that after giving birth,

09:12.200 --> 09:13.399
I've let myself go?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.799
You're overthinking it, Young Madam.

09:17.279 --> 09:18.799
You handled this matter well.

09:18.919 --> 09:20.240
Madam Yu may not say it outright,

09:20.960 --> 09:21.960
but in her heart,

09:22.039 --> 09:23.240
she knows exactly what you've done.

09:37.936 --> 09:40.536
(Xie Residence)

09:40.600 --> 09:42.279
Honestly, Mr. Zhao...

09:43.159 --> 09:44.240
he didn't even

09:45.000 --> 09:46.200
reject Miss Wu to her face.

09:49.639 --> 09:51.039
He has his reasons.

09:52.240 --> 09:53.320
The merchant dispute

09:53.320 --> 09:54.399
is tied to the salt reform.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.759
He probably couldn't reject her
outright.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.240
He still should've done something
to reassure you.

09:59.639 --> 10:00.759
It's been a whole night,

10:01.159 --> 10:02.759
and he hasn't even come to apologize.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.879
If you keep letting this slide,

10:05.200 --> 10:07.080
who knows what kind
of trouble it'll cause.

10:07.639 --> 10:08.600
What kind of trouble?

10:12.519 --> 10:14.279
A new pastry shop opened
at the end of the alley.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.360
I heard from a colleague

10:18.200 --> 10:19.519
that their chestnut cakes
are quite good.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.559
Try one.

10:23.759 --> 10:24.879
See if you like it.

10:27.338 --> 10:30.604
(Chestnut Pastries)

10:31.279 --> 10:33.200
Mr. Zhao, you came all this way

10:34.720 --> 10:36.279
just to bring me chestnut cakes?

10:40.240 --> 10:42.200
Of course I'm here about Miss Wu.

10:44.399 --> 10:45.519
There's no way

10:45.840 --> 10:47.519
I'm taking her in.

10:47.840 --> 10:49.360
That's enough.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.720
He does care about you after all.

10:51.879 --> 10:53.000
Besides, Miss Wu

10:53.679 --> 10:54.519
comes from the Anzhou merchants.

10:55.559 --> 10:57.200
If I just take her in,

10:57.399 --> 10:58.200
then in the future,

10:58.200 --> 10:59.440
if someone wanted to plant someone

10:59.440 --> 11:00.399
by my side to scheme against me,

11:01.759 --> 11:02.519
who knows what could happen?

11:04.120 --> 11:05.799
So that's why you

11:07.080 --> 11:08.679
won't take Miss Wu in?

11:11.480 --> 11:13.360
It's difficult for me
to handle this personally.

11:15.679 --> 11:17.000
The salt reform is
under intense scrutiny.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.559
Anything I do

11:19.679 --> 11:21.559
will be read as a political signal.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.759
And I don't want to offend
the Anzhou merchants.

11:24.120 --> 11:25.279
So could you

11:26.279 --> 11:28.000
help me settle the matter?

11:31.639 --> 11:33.679
So you came here to put me to work.

11:34.360 --> 11:36.399
You want to use me as your shield?

11:40.559 --> 11:42.759
Life together is like rowing a boat.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.639
Two rowers will always beat one.

11:47.039 --> 11:48.440
Besides, with your abilities,

11:48.559 --> 11:49.960
even ten Miss Wus

11:50.039 --> 11:51.120
wouldn't be a match for you.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.919
And if I weren't so capable?

11:53.799 --> 11:55.720
Would you simply take her in?

11:56.799 --> 11:58.799
How could you not be?

12:03.840 --> 12:05.080
As far as I'm concerned,

12:05.840 --> 12:07.480
there's nothing to settle.

12:08.320 --> 12:10.519
Why don't you just take Miss Wu in

12:10.840 --> 12:12.840
so the salt reform can proceed?

12:21.879 --> 12:23.200
Miss Wu

12:24.480 --> 12:26.039
isn't just connected
to the Anzhou merchants.

12:26.279 --> 12:27.679
She also has ties to the Yu family.

12:28.399 --> 12:29.200
The Yu family

12:29.600 --> 12:31.399
is taking advantage of the fact

12:31.399 --> 12:32.480
that I can't openly refuse,

12:33.720 --> 12:34.960
trying to plant someone by my side.

12:37.720 --> 12:38.840
That's why

12:39.679 --> 12:41.519
I absolutely cannot take her in.

12:41.720 --> 12:42.639
Why not?

12:44.679 --> 12:45.120
What...?

12:46.919 --> 12:48.360
She didn't mean that... right?

13:01.440 --> 13:02.399
(Five years apart.)

13:02.399 --> 13:03.720
(Every time Mr. Zhao comes,
it's about work.)

13:03.720 --> 13:05.200
(Instead of getting married,
you've become colleagues.)

13:05.200 --> 13:05.679
(Xie Jewelry Shop)
Let's go.

13:05.679 --> 13:06.360
- Sis.
- Over there.

13:06.360 --> 13:06.960
Miss Xie,

13:07.360 --> 13:08.360
there's a customer

13:08.360 --> 13:09.600
who's impossible to please.

13:09.600 --> 13:10.919
We've shown her

13:10.919 --> 13:12.159
all our hair accessories.

13:12.159 --> 13:13.080
If it's expensive,

13:13.080 --> 13:14.720
she says the design is tacky.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.200
If the design is good,

13:16.200 --> 13:16.960
she complains

13:17.080 --> 13:18.000
about the materials.

13:18.519 --> 13:19.519
And when the materials are good,

13:19.519 --> 13:20.759
she says it's too expensive.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.120
Don't worry about her.

13:23.399 --> 13:24.679
She's here for me.

13:42.919 --> 13:43.879
Miss Xie.

13:44.519 --> 13:46.720
This hairpin is meant as a gift for you.

13:47.919 --> 13:49.519
That's why I was being so particular.

13:50.279 --> 13:51.399
I had no idea

13:51.679 --> 13:53.399
this shop belonged to you.

13:53.639 --> 13:54.639
Please forgive me.

13:56.039 --> 13:57.360
We're open for business.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.519
Anyone who walks in is a customer.

13:58.919 --> 14:00.600
But this gift of yours, Miss Wu,

14:00.919 --> 14:02.080
is far too generous.

14:02.440 --> 14:03.960
How could I possibly accept it?

14:03.960 --> 14:05.200
Of course you can.

14:06.559 --> 14:07.799
I've long heard

14:07.799 --> 14:08.879
that you, Miss Xie,

14:08.879 --> 14:10.000
having made the county gazetteer
three times.

14:10.279 --> 14:11.559
and are quite an extraordinary woman.

14:12.120 --> 14:13.679
You have both wisdom

14:13.799 --> 14:15.320
and good fortune in abundance.

14:15.919 --> 14:16.960
If in the future

14:17.039 --> 14:18.960
we are to live under the same roof,

14:19.399 --> 14:21.000
I will respect you

14:21.240 --> 14:22.279
and defer to you in all things.

14:23.679 --> 14:25.159
What do you mean by that?

14:25.440 --> 14:27.360
Who says you're going to live with us?

14:28.639 --> 14:30.039
A woman's reputation

14:30.039 --> 14:31.159
can be a matter of life and death.

14:31.879 --> 14:33.200
At the Willow-Shooting Gathering
that day,

14:33.200 --> 14:34.080
didn't he already...?

14:35.200 --> 14:36.039
Could it be

14:36.639 --> 14:38.120
that I misunderstood?

14:38.120 --> 14:39.279
Yes, you did.

14:43.960 --> 14:46.080
You're a sharp woman, Miss Wu.

14:47.240 --> 14:49.159
You're determined to marry
into the Zhao family

14:49.399 --> 14:50.639
because you know

14:50.720 --> 14:52.200
there are no parents-in-law
to answer to,

14:52.200 --> 14:53.480
and no sisters-in-law
to make your life difficult.

14:53.919 --> 14:55.759
Once you bear him a child,

14:55.840 --> 14:57.159
you'll have secured your place.

14:57.879 --> 14:59.519
But for all your careful planning,

14:59.519 --> 15:00.480
you forgot one thing.

15:00.799 --> 15:01.840
What if I'm jealous

15:01.840 --> 15:02.960
and make your life miserable every day?

15:02.960 --> 15:03.840
How could that be?

15:04.879 --> 15:06.919
You're known for being broad-minded,
Miss Xie,

15:07.240 --> 15:08.759
a model for other women.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.799
How could you possibly mistreat me?

15:14.559 --> 15:16.440
I can be broad-minded
about other things.

15:17.039 --> 15:18.919
But when it comes to love and marriage,

15:19.200 --> 15:21.720
I won't share even a fraction
of his love with another woman.

15:24.679 --> 15:26.519
Since you know my past,

15:26.519 --> 15:27.600
you should know

15:27.840 --> 15:28.919
what I'm capable of.

15:29.879 --> 15:31.279
Do you truly wish

15:31.279 --> 15:32.399
to contend with me?

15:40.919 --> 15:42.159
I won't make things difficult for you.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.720
I know this isn't your decision to make.

15:44.399 --> 15:45.559
Have your aunt

15:45.559 --> 15:46.440
come speak to me.

15:46.559 --> 15:48.919
But how could you possibly
persuade my aunt?

15:49.279 --> 15:50.600
Everyone wants different things.

15:51.399 --> 15:52.600
Everyone has their own desires.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.360
That's why conflict never ends

15:55.360 --> 15:56.720
and schemes never cease.

15:57.440 --> 15:58.480
But even the cleverest scheme

15:58.480 --> 15:59.399
has flaws.

15:59.639 --> 16:00.799
An open strategy is different.

16:01.240 --> 16:02.480
Give each side what it wants,

16:02.919 --> 16:04.080
and both sides can benefit.

16:05.843 --> 16:08.630
(Xie Residence)

16:14.120 --> 16:15.240
Greetings, Miss Xie.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.279
We meet again.

16:37.200 --> 16:39.600
When Madam Yu persuaded you
to offer up your niece,

16:40.440 --> 16:41.799
did she mention that Commander Zhao

16:42.000 --> 16:43.440
was overseeing the salt reform?

16:45.480 --> 16:46.639
Though I suspect

16:47.799 --> 16:49.279
she only told you half the story

16:49.600 --> 16:50.639
and kept the rest to herself.

16:51.399 --> 16:52.279
Otherwise,

16:52.519 --> 16:54.200
a shrewd businesswoman like you

16:54.320 --> 16:56.000
would never agree to a losing deal.

16:58.960 --> 17:00.559
Miss Xie, you give me too much credit.

17:01.039 --> 17:02.480
I'm only a merchant's wife.

17:02.480 --> 17:04.880
All the twists and turns
of official politics

17:04.880 --> 17:06.079
are quite beyond me.

17:06.920 --> 17:09.000
It's true that Commander Zhao
is overseeing the salt reform,

17:10.079 --> 17:11.680
but it's only a temporary assignment.

17:12.480 --> 17:13.759
Once things settle down,

17:14.319 --> 17:15.920
his duties may have nothing
to do with salt at all.

17:16.039 --> 17:17.000
By then,

17:17.400 --> 17:19.000
even if he wanted to intervene,

17:19.279 --> 17:21.079
he might have no power to do so.

17:26.319 --> 17:27.599
Is that true?

17:27.759 --> 17:29.880
You've been in business for years,
Madam Wu.

17:30.119 --> 17:31.240
You can judge for yourself.

17:32.799 --> 17:34.160
Think about it.

17:34.759 --> 17:36.839
Commander Zhao's power base
is in the northwest.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.279
It relies on the grain-for-salt system,

17:39.279 --> 17:39.880
grain transport,

17:39.880 --> 17:40.720
and frontier defense.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.960
If one day

17:43.680 --> 17:46.079
his own position forces him
to avoid a conflict of interest

17:46.079 --> 17:47.319
and step away from the salt reform,

17:47.839 --> 17:49.119
then, Madam Wu,

17:49.240 --> 17:50.640
what will you do?

17:57.599 --> 17:59.160
That Madam Yu.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.119
She fooled me with half the truth.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.440
Once she had me convinced,

18:03.440 --> 18:04.640
she conveniently left out that Zhao Ling

18:04.640 --> 18:06.000
was only serving in a temporary post.

18:06.440 --> 18:08.079
I nearly fell right into her trap

18:08.519 --> 18:09.519
and made

18:09.519 --> 18:11.200
a disastrous deal.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.319
Good thing it's not too late.

18:17.039 --> 18:18.160
Miss Xie

18:18.160 --> 18:19.599
really is something.

18:19.759 --> 18:21.720
Even someone as calculating as your aunt

18:21.720 --> 18:22.680
was no match for her.

18:29.759 --> 18:30.720
All these years,

18:31.160 --> 18:32.640
I've felt stuck in the mire,

18:34.279 --> 18:35.440
pushed around

18:35.519 --> 18:36.799
and worn down by Aunt,

18:38.240 --> 18:40.240
with no one to turn to,

18:40.960 --> 18:42.160
always living in fear.

18:43.160 --> 18:45.079
If I hadn't met Miss Xie,

18:45.799 --> 18:48.039
I'd still think it was simply
my bad luck

18:48.400 --> 18:49.839
that I hadn't found

18:49.960 --> 18:52.119
a husband good enough to satisfy Aunt.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.359
Isn't

18:53.640 --> 18:54.680
that true?

19:01.880 --> 19:02.759
Cairong,

19:03.559 --> 19:04.920
I think I've found my answer.

19:06.799 --> 19:08.400
If I want a place of my own
in this world,

19:08.920 --> 19:10.119
I can't rely on

19:10.400 --> 19:12.079
what kind of husband I marry.

19:12.839 --> 19:14.240
I have to rely on myself

19:14.799 --> 19:16.519
and build a life of my own.

19:22.720 --> 19:24.000
Look at Miss Xie.

19:25.039 --> 19:26.240
She never seems

19:26.960 --> 19:28.440
to lose her composure.

19:29.319 --> 19:30.960
The worst thing a woman can do

19:31.279 --> 19:33.079
is let herself be trapped
by matters of love.

19:33.519 --> 19:35.759
Ninth Young Lady knows exactly
where to strike.

19:36.640 --> 19:38.200
She never fixated
on household rivalries,

19:38.200 --> 19:39.720
yet she settled them all the same.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.799
She reminds me of myself back then.

19:42.799 --> 19:44.839
I used to act just as decisively.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.519
Madam Wu

19:48.599 --> 19:50.279
is a merchant after all.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.440
All she sees

19:51.680 --> 19:52.839
is profit.

19:54.960 --> 19:55.759
Never mind.

19:56.960 --> 19:58.359
In a marriage,

19:58.680 --> 20:01.279
nothing is worse than growing apart
while living together.

20:01.519 --> 20:03.079
Ninth Young Lady may be able

20:03.079 --> 20:04.799
to handle the bigger picture,

20:04.799 --> 20:07.079
but can she handle what lies
in her own heart?

20:09.559 --> 20:10.799
Has she really

20:11.000 --> 20:12.200
let go?

20:15.160 --> 20:17.079
Huchen, you kept your head
under pressure this time

20:17.079 --> 20:18.559
and handled the merchants well.

20:19.400 --> 20:21.039
I wouldn't dare take the credit.

20:21.799 --> 20:22.680
I owe much of it

20:23.559 --> 20:24.839
to Grand Secretary Tian's guidance.

20:28.200 --> 20:29.160
Minister Tian,

20:29.759 --> 20:31.000
could you perhaps postpone

20:31.000 --> 20:32.400
your medical leave?

20:32.759 --> 20:34.640
If I let a pillar of the court
like you go,

20:35.200 --> 20:36.720
it'd be like losing my right hand.

20:38.960 --> 20:39.880
Your Majesty,

20:41.039 --> 20:42.599
you flatter this old servant.

20:43.279 --> 20:46.319
I was only examined by the Imperial
Medical Bureau last month.

20:47.359 --> 20:48.480
Never mind, then.

20:48.599 --> 20:49.599
Your health comes first.

20:49.839 --> 20:51.240
Have some aged wild renshen sent over

20:51.240 --> 20:52.720
for Grand Secretary Tian's medicine.

20:52.720 --> 20:53.240
Yes, Your Majesty.

20:57.417 --> 20:59.577
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

21:14.079 --> 21:15.279
What are you doing?

21:15.440 --> 21:16.640
I'm going back to Ganlin.

21:16.839 --> 21:17.519
Mr. Zhao,

21:17.519 --> 21:18.319
take care of yourself.

21:19.119 --> 21:19.759
What's wrong?

21:21.319 --> 21:21.759
Wait.

21:22.440 --> 21:22.960
No, wait.

21:23.720 --> 21:24.640
Why?

21:25.000 --> 21:25.880
Isn't everything

21:26.839 --> 21:28.319
going well here in the capital?

21:37.519 --> 21:38.519
Keep these three thousand taels

21:38.799 --> 21:40.279
for your own use.

21:42.720 --> 21:44.240
The salt reform has only just
gotten underway.

21:44.759 --> 21:45.559
From now on,

21:45.799 --> 21:47.759
you'll have plenty of expenses
and people to deal with.

21:49.279 --> 21:49.839
And one more thing.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.440
Don't let a lack of money
tie your hands,

21:52.880 --> 21:54.519
or tempt you into taking
anyone's bribes,

21:55.000 --> 21:55.799
only to

21:56.599 --> 21:57.519
lose far more than you gain.

21:59.079 --> 22:00.680
Is this because of

22:01.440 --> 22:02.920
what happened with Miss Wu?

22:06.400 --> 22:07.480
I swear

22:07.880 --> 22:09.680
I never intended to take her in.

22:09.680 --> 22:10.680
Honestly,

22:11.440 --> 22:13.359
it really was all for the salt reform.

22:16.200 --> 22:18.079
Mr. Zhao, you always have a reason
for everything.

22:19.119 --> 22:20.160
I'm the one who overreacted.

22:21.039 --> 22:21.759
I'm just jealous.

22:25.200 --> 22:27.160
Has someone been gossiping about us?

22:27.680 --> 22:29.359
I'll have their tongue cut out.

22:29.599 --> 22:30.279
Chuan!

22:30.720 --> 22:31.319
Biao!

22:32.680 --> 22:33.440
Mr. Zhao,

22:34.440 --> 22:35.519
do you really not understand,

22:35.759 --> 22:36.759
or are you pretending not to?

22:41.799 --> 22:42.440
- Mr. Zhao.
- Mr. Zhao.

22:42.559 --> 22:43.240
- Who?
- Who?

22:45.680 --> 22:46.279
Miss Xie,

22:46.759 --> 22:47.599
are you moving away?

22:47.960 --> 22:48.839
We'll help.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.000
Okay.

22:50.119 --> 22:50.680
Come on, then.

22:55.839 --> 22:57.039
Miss Xie, where are you going?

22:57.640 --> 22:58.559
Back to Ganlin.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.000
Back to Ganlin?

23:08.160 --> 23:09.039
This is all your fault.

23:21.319 --> 23:22.920
All I want now

23:24.200 --> 23:25.759
is a peaceful life.

23:27.240 --> 23:28.920
There's nothing wrong with you trying
to rise in the world,

23:29.119 --> 23:30.119
and I don't blame you for it.

23:30.880 --> 23:32.359
But being caught up in all of this

23:33.119 --> 23:34.400
has worn me out.

23:48.119 --> 23:49.079
Mr. Zhao,

23:49.359 --> 23:51.640
do you really not understand
why she's angry?

23:54.039 --> 23:55.000
I just think...

23:58.160 --> 23:59.240
she's gotten quite a temper.

23:59.799 --> 24:00.960
It's been five years.

24:01.119 --> 24:02.480
What's wrong with her having
a little temper?

24:02.720 --> 24:05.000
A woman wants to be reassured.

24:05.519 --> 24:07.480
She's waited five years for you.

24:07.680 --> 24:08.920
And the moment you're reunited,

24:08.920 --> 24:10.720
along comes some Miss Wu.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.480
Who wouldn't be upset?

24:13.599 --> 24:14.720
I swear...

24:36.960 --> 24:38.759
Are you really just going
to let her leave?

24:39.400 --> 24:40.640
She's always cautious.

24:40.960 --> 24:41.720
She won't actually leave.

24:47.000 --> 24:47.680
Mr. Zhao,

24:47.960 --> 24:49.039
that's an awful lot of luggage.

24:49.039 --> 24:50.200
This doesn't look like a bluff.

24:57.839 --> 24:59.359
Seriously?

25:03.279 --> 25:03.839
Fine.

25:05.440 --> 25:06.640
Go to Xie's shop at once

25:07.240 --> 25:09.160
and have someone ask Fifth Madam
to come over.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.359
I...

25:11.880 --> 25:12.319
I...

25:12.519 --> 25:13.839
What am I supposed to tell her?

25:15.359 --> 25:16.440
Just tell her

25:18.319 --> 25:19.680
Miss Xie is upset

25:20.519 --> 25:21.759
and ask her to come talk some sense
into her.

25:23.480 --> 25:24.200
Zhao Ling!

25:25.920 --> 25:27.400
If you dare disturb my mother,

25:27.400 --> 25:28.119
just try.

25:29.200 --> 25:29.839
I...

25:34.920 --> 25:36.319
What a blockhead.

25:36.559 --> 25:37.759
I made it that obvious,

25:37.759 --> 25:38.759
and he still didn't understand.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.799
He should understand now.

25:40.799 --> 25:41.839
Don't be upset, Miss Xie.

25:41.839 --> 25:42.519
It's fine.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.720
I...

25:46.279 --> 25:47.759
I was pretty convincing, wasn't I?

25:49.240 --> 25:49.960
Very convincing.

25:56.743 --> 25:59.283
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

26:27.119 --> 26:28.559
We've come such a long way

26:29.680 --> 26:30.920
to finally make it to the capital.

26:31.799 --> 26:32.680
I don't want to see

26:32.680 --> 26:34.000
you and your mother separated again.

26:39.480 --> 26:41.279
I know you're still angry with me.

26:42.920 --> 26:43.599
How about this?

26:44.880 --> 26:45.799
Don't leave.

26:47.160 --> 26:48.279
I'll stay away

26:50.599 --> 26:51.680
for a while.

27:12.904 --> 27:15.484
(Yunshe Hut)

27:16.759 --> 27:17.759
Good child.

27:17.759 --> 27:18.519
Mother.

27:18.799 --> 27:19.799
What are you doing here?

27:20.440 --> 27:21.359
Leave these chores

27:21.359 --> 27:22.359
to me.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.559
Really,

27:23.680 --> 27:25.400
you don't have to come every day.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.519
(Madam Shen, Fu Tingzhuo's Wife)
Tingzhuo is away studying

27:27.799 --> 27:29.039
and can't tend to the family,

27:29.480 --> 27:31.759
so you've had to shoulder
all this yourself.

27:31.960 --> 27:32.880
Father

27:32.880 --> 27:34.279
was only meant to mourn for three years,

27:34.640 --> 27:35.599
yet now

27:35.599 --> 27:36.759
he's lived here in mourning for seven.

27:37.240 --> 27:39.039
Not even the bitterest winters
have stopped him.

27:40.079 --> 27:41.279
Such devotion to his parents

27:41.359 --> 27:42.880
is something we younger generations

27:43.000 --> 27:44.000
ought to follow.

27:45.279 --> 27:46.720
From the city to here

27:47.559 --> 27:49.480
takes two hours even by sedan chair.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.880
A round trip

27:51.680 --> 27:53.079
takes four hours.

27:53.680 --> 27:55.559
It's one thing for old people like us

27:55.759 --> 27:57.480
to spend our days here.

27:57.486 --> 27:58.066
(Fifth Master Fu)

27:58.079 --> 27:59.359
But you're still young.

27:59.799 --> 28:01.759
You're giving up half your day

28:02.640 --> 28:03.880
every time you come.

28:03.960 --> 28:04.839
Mother,

28:06.119 --> 28:07.799
it's the least I should do.

28:08.079 --> 28:08.640
Allow me.

28:20.319 --> 28:21.079
Father.

28:26.440 --> 28:27.160
Mother,

28:27.160 --> 28:28.200
let me get you another one.

28:28.200 --> 28:29.119
There's an opening here.

28:30.880 --> 28:31.400
Wait.

28:32.599 --> 28:33.359
An opening?

28:33.920 --> 28:34.720
What opening?

28:35.920 --> 28:36.720
At the Ministry of Personnel?

28:36.720 --> 28:37.440
The Ministry of Revenue?

28:37.440 --> 28:38.880
Even the Ministry of Rites would do.

28:38.880 --> 28:39.480
Did you

28:39.480 --> 28:40.799
hear about an opening
for my reinstatement?

28:41.799 --> 28:42.799
I meant

28:42.799 --> 28:44.160
there's an opening in the rim.

28:46.440 --> 28:48.759
An opening in the cup's rim.

28:52.079 --> 28:52.640
Never mind.

28:53.559 --> 28:54.920
An opening is good.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.759
An opening is good.

28:57.559 --> 28:59.759
Give Madam the cup without an opening.

29:00.480 --> 29:02.319
I'm feeling a little unwell.

29:02.839 --> 29:03.880
I'll excuse myself.

29:12.240 --> 29:13.319
An opening...

29:13.640 --> 29:15.640
It's a sign from heaven!

29:17.240 --> 29:18.200
Your Majesty,

29:18.799 --> 29:20.680
all preparations for the salt reform
are complete.

29:21.160 --> 29:22.640
The salt merchants in every region
have been appeased

29:23.160 --> 29:24.400
and are willing to cooperate
with the new policy.

29:24.920 --> 29:25.839
I recommend

29:26.240 --> 29:27.680
piloting it first in Anzhou

29:28.400 --> 29:29.359
to see how effective it is.

29:33.359 --> 29:34.480
I submit it all

29:35.440 --> 29:36.440
for Your Majesty's review and decision.

29:40.480 --> 29:41.799
You've handled this matter well.

29:42.319 --> 29:44.559
The northwest has just
sent some fine sheep as tribute.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.640
I'll grant you one.

29:46.160 --> 29:48.839
As for the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor,

29:51.480 --> 29:52.000
I

29:52.319 --> 29:54.519
want to see results from the salt reform
as soon as possible.

29:54.759 --> 29:55.400
So

29:55.559 --> 29:57.319
I need someone decisive.

29:57.880 --> 29:58.880
This is a matter of great importance.

29:59.319 --> 30:01.559
Besides the candidates proposed
by the Ministry of Personnel,

30:01.759 --> 30:02.559
I need you

30:02.960 --> 30:04.200
to help me

30:04.319 --> 30:05.960
find another suitable match.

30:06.079 --> 30:06.720
Yes,

30:07.720 --> 30:08.480
Your Majesty.

30:24.400 --> 30:25.920
How festive.

30:37.200 --> 30:38.640
Is today's meal

30:39.119 --> 30:40.759
not to your liking, Father?

30:41.519 --> 30:43.160
Something's missing.

30:43.559 --> 30:44.440
What's missing?

30:44.799 --> 30:46.319
A sheep.

30:46.400 --> 30:47.119
Father,

30:47.319 --> 30:48.400
you've been in mourning for seven years

30:48.400 --> 30:49.440
and abstaining from meat.

30:49.440 --> 30:50.240
Mutton...

30:50.240 --> 30:51.319
You fool.

30:52.279 --> 30:53.880
Who said I wanted to eat it?

30:55.880 --> 30:57.160
The word for sheep

30:57.799 --> 30:58.880
signifies good fortune.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.160
It is an honor bestowed
upon high ministers.

31:02.079 --> 31:03.240
As a mark of imperial favor,

31:03.400 --> 31:05.279
His Majesty often grants

31:05.279 --> 31:06.759
a live sheep to his most
trusted ministers.

31:07.240 --> 31:08.599
One of the Fu ancestors

31:08.599 --> 31:10.599
received the honor when he was appointed
Grand Guardian of the Crown Prince.

31:10.599 --> 31:11.559
He was once granted one too.

31:11.799 --> 31:13.519
Sadly, in my generation,

31:14.039 --> 31:16.519
we've never seen such glory again.

31:17.359 --> 31:19.319
Young people know nothing
of these customs.

31:20.000 --> 31:21.119
He receives an imperial gift,

31:21.960 --> 31:23.279
yet doesn't know to honor his elders
with it.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.559
Commander Zhao surely doesn't know
the tradition.

31:25.559 --> 31:26.440
If he did,

31:26.440 --> 31:27.319
he would surely send it over.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.559
He doesn't know any better,

31:29.559 --> 31:30.599
but surely you do!

31:36.200 --> 31:37.720
I was foolish.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.920
I'll send someone at once

31:38.920 --> 31:40.359
to Commander Zhao's office

31:40.440 --> 31:42.160
and say the elders of the family

31:42.359 --> 31:44.200
would like to see
His Majesty's imperial gift.

31:56.999 --> 31:57.899
(To Shichang:
Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor is open.)

31:57.899 --> 31:58.768
(The time is ripe. Act now.)

31:58.799 --> 32:00.480
It won't be long

32:00.680 --> 32:03.880
before I can wear you openly.

32:07.680 --> 32:09.599
This is the opening.

32:22.720 --> 32:23.319
Miss Xie,

32:23.519 --> 32:24.559
Mr. Zhao sent this over.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.640
It's a tribute sheep

32:25.640 --> 32:26.519
bestowed by His Majesty.

32:26.519 --> 32:27.319
He especially wanted you

32:27.319 --> 32:27.920
to have a taste.

32:32.079 --> 32:32.640
Then...

32:34.839 --> 32:36.799
is he coming back for dinner today?

32:36.799 --> 32:37.599
Mr. Zhao said

32:37.599 --> 32:38.799
he's been very busy
with official matters

32:38.799 --> 32:39.519
and can't get away,

32:39.519 --> 32:40.359
so he won't be coming back.

33:00.160 --> 33:01.559
On the ninth of every month,

33:01.559 --> 33:03.680
Mr. Zhao always brings
the lamp oil himself.

33:03.920 --> 33:05.039
These past few days,

33:05.160 --> 33:06.440
perhaps his official duties

33:06.440 --> 33:07.519
have been especially demanding.

33:09.119 --> 33:10.319
Is he really busy,

33:11.200 --> 33:12.319
or does he just not want to come?

33:14.559 --> 33:15.759
Take the sheep back!

33:16.000 --> 33:17.319
We're out of lamp oil!

33:17.319 --> 33:18.359
How are we supposed to enjoy it?

33:18.519 --> 33:19.599
Send it back exactly as it came!

33:27.200 --> 33:27.960
Sanniang,

33:28.079 --> 33:28.880
does this mutton

33:29.079 --> 33:31.039
need lamp oil to roast it or something?

33:31.279 --> 33:32.759
What am I supposed to tell Mr. Zhao?

33:33.759 --> 33:34.960
You fool.

33:35.160 --> 33:36.640
Tell him exactly

33:36.640 --> 33:37.799
what Miss Xie said.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.039
Don't change

33:39.119 --> 33:40.440
a single word.

33:44.246 --> 33:45.206
Miss Xie said,

33:45.319 --> 33:46.799
"We're out of lamp oil.

33:46.799 --> 33:47.799
How are we supposed to enjoy it?

33:48.039 --> 33:49.039
Take the sheep back."

33:51.640 --> 33:52.880
That's exactly what she said?

33:57.799 --> 33:59.200
"We're out of lamp oil!

33:59.200 --> 34:00.039
How are we supposed to enjoy it?

34:00.039 --> 34:00.920
Take the sheep back!"

34:00.920 --> 34:01.400
I...

34:02.440 --> 34:03.839
That's exactly what she said.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.599
What on earth is she mad about?

34:08.000 --> 34:09.079
Do we roast mutton

34:09.079 --> 34:10.440
with lamp oil?

34:11.280 --> 34:12.400
I didn't bring it to her.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.599
She didn't come get it either.

34:19.000 --> 34:19.599
Mr. Zhao.

34:20.960 --> 34:21.480
Mr. Zhao.

34:22.599 --> 34:23.960
(To Commander Zhao)
A letter came from the Fu family.

34:25.039 --> 34:25.920
Which Fu family?

34:26.000 --> 34:27.280
Which one do you think?

34:27.800 --> 34:29.800
Miss Xie's own father,

34:31.239 --> 34:32.320
Fifth Master Fu, of course.

34:33.559 --> 34:34.920
Back then, Fifth Master Fu

34:34.920 --> 34:36.360
was implicated in the Huaying salt case

34:36.719 --> 34:38.119
and nearly lost his post.

34:42.559 --> 34:45.400
Old Madam Fu died around that time.

34:48.760 --> 34:50.199
He used his mourning leave

34:51.280 --> 34:52.639
to preserve his official standing
for the time being,

34:53.239 --> 34:54.719
then built a mourning hut
at Phoenix Ridge

34:54.719 --> 34:55.840
outside the capital.

34:57.519 --> 34:58.599
He abstains from women,

34:58.599 --> 34:59.639
eats no meat,

34:59.639 --> 35:01.159
and wears only coarse mourning clothes.

35:01.440 --> 35:03.400
But I hear Old Madam Fu's grave

35:04.760 --> 35:06.639
still stands outside his hut

35:09.280 --> 35:11.039
instead of in the Fu ancestral cemetery.

35:12.119 --> 35:13.880
He's practically buried himself there
with her.

35:14.199 --> 35:15.840
Mourning only requires three years,

35:16.079 --> 35:18.438
yet he's kept this up
outside the capital for seven.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.035
(May you win imperial favor.)

35:19.039 --> 35:20.979
He's probably trying to build himself
a reputation as a devoted son

35:21.440 --> 35:23.320
while waiting for a chance to return
to the office.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.880
The men of the Fu family

35:24.880 --> 35:26.719
have finally learned
to guard their own arches.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.400
I suppose that's some improvement.

35:29.920 --> 35:30.960
Have the horses ready tomorrow.

35:32.119 --> 35:33.679
I'm going to Phoenix Ridge.

35:34.103 --> 35:34.870
(To Commander Zhao,
Jinwu Vanguard Office)

35:34.880 --> 35:37.320
He hasn't asked about his daughter once
in five years.

35:38.119 --> 35:39.480
And now he sent a letter?

35:40.480 --> 35:41.960
Fifth Master Fu

35:43.559 --> 35:45.840
must be getting impatient to return
to the office.

35:55.000 --> 35:56.320
Why haven't you come in?

35:56.599 --> 35:57.800
I wouldn't dare enter

35:58.360 --> 35:59.519
without your invitation.

36:03.639 --> 36:04.320
Come in.

36:11.320 --> 36:12.320
I've been tied up

36:12.519 --> 36:13.559
with official duties lately

36:13.880 --> 36:14.960
and couldn't come pay
my respects sooner.

36:15.559 --> 36:16.639
Please forgive me.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.760
But you've always been

36:19.159 --> 36:20.360
on my mind.

36:20.840 --> 36:22.679
If you know you should be ashamed,
Commander Zhao,

36:22.800 --> 36:23.599
then why

36:23.599 --> 36:24.679
did you wait until today?

36:24.800 --> 36:26.119
Without your letter,

36:26.800 --> 36:27.960
I wouldn't have dared
call on you uninvited.

36:29.079 --> 36:30.480
I was afraid of disturbing your peace.

36:31.320 --> 36:32.800
Commander Zhao, have you come this time

36:32.800 --> 36:33.960
to have

36:34.519 --> 36:36.119
Tingyun return to the Fu family?

36:37.480 --> 36:38.480
With parents' approval,

36:38.960 --> 36:39.880
and a proper matchmaker,

36:40.320 --> 36:41.480
I hope

36:42.159 --> 36:44.119
to marry Tingyun properly and honorably.

36:45.360 --> 36:46.400
I also hope

36:47.559 --> 36:49.000
to have her parents' blessing.

36:51.280 --> 36:51.840
Good.

36:53.239 --> 36:53.800
Good.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.280
Commander Zhao,

36:56.400 --> 36:57.800
the Fu family

36:59.000 --> 37:00.639
places great importance on filial piety.

37:01.199 --> 37:03.199
Filial piety comes
before all other virtues.

37:04.599 --> 37:06.679
Shouldn't you show us

37:06.920 --> 37:08.719
some real proof of that?

37:25.199 --> 37:26.119
Is this

37:27.679 --> 37:29.320
meant for the family

37:30.840 --> 37:32.519
or for outsiders to see?

37:49.760 --> 37:50.280
No need.

38:39.280 --> 38:40.360
Why hasn't the lamp oil

38:41.000 --> 38:42.559
arrived yet?

38:44.000 --> 38:45.159
Mr. Zhao...

38:46.920 --> 38:48.519
Maybe the rain is too heavy

38:49.159 --> 38:50.519
and something delayed him.

38:50.599 --> 38:51.280
Miss Xie,

38:51.280 --> 38:52.000
let's wait a little longer.

38:56.679 --> 38:57.599
Wait for what?

39:01.480 --> 39:02.360
Does he really expect me

39:02.760 --> 39:04.440
to keep begging him to come?

39:05.159 --> 39:06.719
Why am I the one who has
to humor him now?

39:06.840 --> 39:07.440
Miss Xie,

39:09.000 --> 39:10.519
Fifth Master Fu sent Mr. Zhao a letter.

39:10.679 --> 39:11.559
Mr. Zhao went there

39:11.679 --> 39:12.960
and is kneeling outside the gate
right now.

39:14.400 --> 39:15.280
How long has he been kneeling?

39:15.920 --> 39:17.159
A full four hours.

39:22.639 --> 39:24.239
The rain is pouring down.

39:24.239 --> 39:25.039
And from what I saw,

39:25.119 --> 39:26.440
Mr. Zhao's face was flushed

39:26.519 --> 39:27.440
and his forehead was burning.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.639
I'm afraid he's fallen ill.

39:30.480 --> 39:31.599
The roads are slippery in this rain.

39:32.159 --> 39:32.880
Get the carriage ready.

39:32.960 --> 39:33.639
Now!

40:00.400 --> 40:01.280
Commander Zhao,

40:02.320 --> 40:05.280
your devotion is truly moving.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.800
Your sincerity is beyond doubt.

40:07.519 --> 40:10.320
I hear the post
of the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

40:10.320 --> 40:11.760
is still open.

40:11.840 --> 40:12.679
Perhaps...

40:42.280 --> 40:43.280
Tingyun...

40:45.239 --> 40:46.599
you're all grown up,

40:46.760 --> 40:48.159
and only now you come
to see your father?

40:49.039 --> 40:50.480
I've been away from home
all these years,

40:51.280 --> 40:52.519
yet I never once saw you

40:52.519 --> 40:53.840
send me a single letter.

40:55.119 --> 40:57.480
That's no way to speak to your father.

40:58.079 --> 41:00.719
Commander Zhao and I just
made everything perfectly clear.

41:00.719 --> 41:01.639
Ruler and minister,

41:01.639 --> 41:02.480
father and son, each in their place.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.400
No matter what you say,

41:03.679 --> 41:05.719
you are still my own daughter.

41:07.280 --> 41:08.960
Am I really still your daughter?

41:11.000 --> 41:13.119
Am I a Fu or a Xie?

41:16.719 --> 41:18.719
You never wanted to acknowledge me.

41:19.719 --> 41:20.800
You're only doing this now

41:21.159 --> 41:22.079
because

41:22.079 --> 41:23.440
I can help you regain an official post

41:23.440 --> 41:24.519
and power.

41:25.000 --> 41:26.159
And even then,

41:26.679 --> 41:28.480
you still can't let go of your pride

41:28.920 --> 41:30.119
or bring yourself to bend.

41:31.800 --> 41:33.199
You made Zhao Ling kneel here

41:33.480 --> 41:35.079
just so everyone could see it,

41:35.239 --> 41:36.159
so they'd know

41:36.159 --> 41:37.880
Fifth Master Fu still commands respect.

41:37.880 --> 41:39.880
If that's how you're going
to speak to me,

41:40.800 --> 41:42.679
you don't have to come see me anymore.

41:42.679 --> 41:44.840
There is no way the two of you
will ever get married.

41:45.400 --> 41:47.920
I won't let you see your mother either.

41:48.559 --> 41:49.559
You have my word.

41:54.960 --> 41:57.280
I don't care whether you approve
of our marriage.

41:57.800 --> 41:59.280
Whatever you do,

41:59.679 --> 42:02.039
I will not let Zhao Ling kneel
at your door.

42:03.280 --> 42:04.719
We've done nothing wrong.

42:05.480 --> 42:06.280
We've been neither heartless

42:06.280 --> 42:07.320
nor dishonorable.

42:08.119 --> 42:10.280
So you have no right
to make him kneel before you.

42:27.079 --> 42:28.199
Commander Zhao,

42:29.599 --> 42:31.559
remember what we agreed on

42:32.159 --> 42:33.360
just now.

42:35.009 --> 42:40.340
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

42:41.499 --> 42:47.120
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

42:47.767 --> 42:50.173
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides♪

42:51.119 --> 42:52.039
Let's go home first.

42:52.920 --> 42:54.000
In a couple of days,

42:55.360 --> 42:57.000
I'll bring you back to see your mother.

42:57.537 --> 43:00.344
♪Every lantern rest in peace♪

43:00.670 --> 43:06.020
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

43:07.077 --> 43:12.600
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

43:13.024 --> 43:15.877
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

43:15.917 --> 43:20.197
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

43:21.630 --> 43:24.317
(Next Episode)

43:25.119 --> 43:27.079
The Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

43:27.079 --> 43:28.280
will be

43:28.559 --> 43:30.960
a key figure in carrying
out the salt reform.

43:31.199 --> 43:32.719
But if we choose the right man,

43:33.039 --> 43:34.559
(Respectfully submitted by Shen Congsi)
he can share Zhao Ling's burden

43:34.920 --> 43:36.719
and leave the northwest some room
to survive.

43:37.159 --> 43:38.719
His Majesty is pushing
through the salt reform.

43:38.800 --> 43:40.760
This post is crucial.

43:40.760 --> 43:42.400
Adding a name to the recommendation list

43:42.800 --> 43:43.920
should be easy

43:43.920 --> 43:45.199
for you.

43:45.480 --> 43:46.840
This position

43:46.960 --> 43:48.599
is one I am determined to secure.

43:48.840 --> 43:50.920
(Since I volunteered
for this assignment,)

43:51.280 --> 43:52.679
(I have to see it through.)

43:52.840 --> 43:54.159
(With the salt reform about to begin,)

43:54.559 --> 43:55.960
(someone has to)

43:56.239 --> 43:58.239
(speak for the northwest garrisons.)

44:11.401 --> 44:15.721
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:19.321 --> 44:23.681
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:25.801 --> 44:30.441
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:30.681 --> 44:33.481
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

44:34.641 --> 44:39.281
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

44:42.481 --> 44:49.321
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

44:50.201 --> 44:56.721
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

44:57.681 --> 45:01.121
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:01.641 --> 45:05.841
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:06.121 --> 45:11.801
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:23.921 --> 45:27.801
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:31.721 --> 45:35.721
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

45:37.441 --> 45:42.121
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

45:42.441 --> 45:45.121
♪Kept close within my heart♪

45:46.201 --> 45:51.041
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

45:54.561 --> 46:01.481
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:02.361 --> 46:08.841
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:09.721 --> 46:13.241
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:13.681 --> 46:18.041
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:18.241 --> 46:23.961
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
